Yet Another Fortunate Accident

This actually happened to me when I was fairly new to the game.

I'm in medusa land.  I'm fighting some baddie and he digs down to a
lower at the same spot where a statue is.  I didn't realise this and
since there was as statue there I didn't see the hole.  As I go to
collect the loot I expect I fall down the hole.  When this happens I
try to head right back up.

I did that this time.

I had to fight a monster with a gase attack near the up stairs so I
had my towel on.  I also had an amulet of reflection that I
habitually wore.  I forgot to remove it when going up the stairs. When
I go up the stairs I get a message that I killed Medusa.

I didn't even know Medusa existed at the time.

